      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT ABE (2) has been in sparkling form, last time showing brilliant early pace and proving too slick around Shepparton over 450m in 25.21, making it three wins on end. The hardest to beat again. PAW DAMON (1) produced a moderate run last time when seventh at Geelong over 460m behind Impetuously (25.94) in a Grade 4/5. Placed at his previous run. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from three starts. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. FLAGMAN FRANKY (6) could manage only third but ran handy time (22.67) at Geelong over 400m. Harder here but expected to measure up. PAW GUSTO (4) has merit but will need to be at his best to take this out.",
